|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{HeadingSetting|'''Movie&amp;amp;nbsp;Settings'''}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Setting|'''Movie name'''|Specifies the resource name of the movie.}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Setting|'''Movie is initially playing'''|Causes the movie to start playing when the panel is loaded.}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
